From: Demitri Nava <demitri@boltz.bio>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:03:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: expose source artifact provenance

Source artifacts expose package-relative short paths but no supported way
to recover their complete path and origin cell after reexports. Parsing
their diagnostic representation makes rule behavior depend on formatting.

Expose documented source_path and source_cell metadata while keeping
build artifacts, including unbound declarations, distinct with None.
Preserve original cell identity and complete projected paths regardless
of hidden short-path prefixes.
